WEBVTT

00:01.396 --> 00:03.648
What miraculous good fortune!

00:03.732 --> 00:06.860
Had I not spilled that coffee…

00:07.903 --> 00:12.115
<i>How… Howie that possible? I…</i>

00:13.575 --> 00:14.784
Puny waif…

00:14.826 --> 00:18.079
So you poked your nose around
to find Stray Cat, too!

00:20.624 --> 00:22.125
Why bother…

00:22.250 --> 00:25.044
As long as I keep
Bites the Dust activated,

00:25.087 --> 00:28.173
it will function
to keep protecting you.

00:34.179 --> 00:36.431
<i>I… I blew it!</i>

00:36.473 --> 00:39.309
<i>I-It's almost time!</i>

00:39.935 --> 00:41.561
You tried to off me

00:41.603 --> 00:45.148
with one of Stray Cat's
compressed air projectiles…

00:45.190 --> 00:49.277
Hayato, there's no way you would
have come up with such an idea

00:49.319 --> 00:53.323
if you hadn't already experienced
this morning three, no, four times.

00:54.074 --> 00:55.742
The fact that you have
lived through this morning

00:55.784 --> 00:57.076
four times now…

00:59.204 --> 01:01.414
Tells me that Bites the Dust
is destined

01:01.873 --> 01:03.666
to eradicate not just Rohan,

01:03.708 --> 01:06.836
but at least one of
his mates as well.

01:07.462 --> 01:11.962
Which means you mentioned something
about me to Rohan and someone else.

01:14.386 --> 01:17.180
Or perhaps you were the center
of some kind of interrogation.

01:17.264 --> 01:19.015
Now whom did you murder?

01:19.099 --> 01:22.644
Hm? Did you see a little runt
by the name of Koichi?

01:22.727 --> 01:25.104
What about Jotaro Kujo?

01:25.147 --> 01:28.483
To receive news of his demise
would send me over the moon.

01:29.025 --> 01:31.152
<i>It's all over…</i>

01:31.361 --> 01:33.363
It's far too risky for me
to let you relive this morning

01:33.405 --> 01:35.698
any more than you already have.

01:36.700 --> 01:39.077
It'll only open me up to attack.

01:39.786 --> 01:41.078
Once the others die,

01:41.163 --> 01:43.790
I'll temporarily disengage
Bites the Dust.

01:49.171 --> 01:51.381
Bites the Dust is all powerful!

01:51.423 --> 01:55.135
Luck is finally on
Yoshikage Kira's side!

01:58.138 --> 02:02.638
That name…
The name you said just now…

02:04.144 --> 02:08.439
Oops, did I just disclose
my true name?

02:09.608 --> 02:12.736
You heard it, I'm Yoshikage Kira.

02:14.529 --> 02:17.240
Feel free to tell anyone
you would like.

02:17.699 --> 02:20.076
By the way, what time is it?

02:20.452 --> 02:21.703
I…

02:21.995 --> 02:23.830
I didn't tell a soul.

02:24.039 --> 02:28.501
I never said a single word
to a single person, ever.

02:29.628 --> 02:32.505
I only made a phone call.

02:32.547 --> 02:35.091
He said that he overslept
and was late,

02:35.175 --> 02:37.844
so I found his number
and woke him up.

02:37.886 --> 02:41.055
I called him from the house
this morning, nothing more!

02:42.557 --> 02:44.433
You gave it away.

02:44.476 --> 02:46.895
You gave away your identity, you!

02:46.937 --> 02:49.314
I was just biding my time.

02:49.606 --> 02:51.608
Waiting for him to ditch
the extra winks

02:51.691 --> 02:53.317
and get here a little earlier!

03:07.374 --> 03:09.042
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

03:09.751 --> 03:11.836
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

03:23.765 --> 03:25.433
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

03:26.601 --> 03:28.185
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

03:33.525 --> 03:38.025
<i>Let the voice of love
take you higher</i>

03:38.613 --> 03:43.113
<i>Let the gathering forces
overcome time itself</i>

03:46.288 --> 03:50.788
<i>Let the joy of love
give you an answer</i>

03:51.251 --> 03:55.751
<i>Our Willis unbreakable
even when it's time to part</i>

03:57.632 --> 04:02.132
<i>1999 Bizarre Summer</i>

04:02.554 --> 04:07.054
<i>This is the hymn born from
our fearless hearts</i>

04:11.021 --> 04:14.524
<i>Great Days
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

04:14.608 --> 04:16.276
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

04:17.402 --> 04:19.028
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

04:20.238 --> 04:21.864
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

04:25.744 --> 04:27.537
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

04:28.538 --> 04:33.038
EPISODE 37
SHINING D (DIAMOND)
IS UNBREAKABLE, PART 1

04:30.415 --> 04:32.166
Hey, Josuke.

04:32.208 --> 04:33.648
We're gonna make it to
the big meeting on time after all.

04:34.919 --> 04:36.378
Stop right there, Okuyasu!

04:36.421 --> 04:39.132
I can't say
if it's pure chance or fate,

04:39.507 --> 04:42.426
but I just heard this guy
say a certain name,

04:42.510 --> 04:44.136
and I don't believe my ears.

04:44.179 --> 04:46.222
I don't believe it!

04:46.640 --> 04:48.308
I know what I heard,

04:48.350 --> 04:50.685
you just uttered the name
"Yoshikage Kira".

04:50.727 --> 04:52.186
Huh? What?!

04:53.938 --> 04:55.397
What are the chances…

04:55.482 --> 04:57.233
This is no chance!

04:57.442 --> 05:00.403
This isn't fate at work either!
It's called making a gamble!

05:00.445 --> 05:02.071
I made a huge bet!

05:02.238 --> 05:04.073
And he just arrived!

05:04.115 --> 05:05.741
There's no doubt you said it!

05:05.825 --> 05:08.202
That name just
came out of your mouth!

05:09.788 --> 05:10.872
It can't be…

05:10.914 --> 05:12.081
Dirty killer!

05:14.542 --> 05:17.461
Don't worry, if you happen
to have the same exact name,

05:17.545 --> 05:20.047
I can heal you
at any time I need to.

05:20.090 --> 05:22.425
This bastard's Yoshikage Kira?

05:22.884 --> 05:26.596
Th-That's impossible… You brat!

05:29.265 --> 05:31.517
<i>This can't be happening…</i>

05:31.559 --> 05:35.563
<i>I have to turn off Bites the Dust
so I can protect myself!</i>

05:37.023 --> 05:38.816
Get back here, Deadly Queen!

05:51.746 --> 05:52.788
I'm getting cold…

05:52.831 --> 05:54.541
The rain is trickling
down my back now.

05:54.916 --> 05:58.252
Dammit,
can no one show up on time?

06:06.094 --> 06:07.136
Oh?

06:07.429 --> 06:09.806
That's Koichi and Jotaro.

06:15.729 --> 06:19.482
Yes! I beat the clock!
I beat destiny!

06:20.275 --> 06:22.568
I was never one
for rapturous highs.

06:23.486 --> 06:26.489
No, my goal is a life
sans dispiriting lows…

06:26.531 --> 06:29.575
to live as carefree as a daisy,

06:29.617 --> 06:33.829
to live with peace
and tranquility.

06:33.913 --> 06:35.873
You've finally revealed
your true self!

06:35.957 --> 06:39.835
Now let me knock that peace and
tranquility right off your face.

06:39.919 --> 06:42.963
Who would've guessed
we'd happen to run into

06:43.006 --> 06:45.591
the guy from Rohan's picture.

06:45.842 --> 06:49.428
I don't think we just ran into
this guy by chance, Okuyasu.

06:49.471 --> 06:51.139
I don't know exactly
what's going on here,

06:51.181 --> 06:54.809
but the fact that he just revealed
his real name to Hayato Kawajiri,

06:54.851 --> 06:58.020
tells me we got here
in just the nick of time.

07:01.816 --> 07:06.316
I should tell you, I wasn't
running away from you fools.

07:08.114 --> 07:09.990
I can obliterate any one of you

07:10.033 --> 07:12.410
the instant the thought
occurs to me.

07:12.827 --> 07:17.327
I simply detest conflict.

07:19.125 --> 07:20.751
Conflict runs completely counter to

07:20.835 --> 07:24.672
the peace and tranquility
I strive for, and I despise it.

07:24.964 --> 07:28.592
It's really quite simple to
rise victorious in a single battle,

07:28.802 --> 07:32.722
but then the stress begins to
pile up before the next one.

07:32.764 --> 07:34.223
It's a foolish endeavor.

07:34.307 --> 07:37.560
To engage in conflict
is to engage in endless futility.

07:38.102 --> 07:41.897
It's because you murdered Shigechi
that we're here now, freak in idiot!

07:42.023 --> 07:44.400
Some sick sonuvabitch whose
hobby is killing innocent people

07:44.442 --> 07:47.069
shouldn't get the privilege
of flapping his gums,

07:47.111 --> 07:48.445
you cat-eyed piece of shit!

07:53.743 --> 07:55.411
Be careful, Josuke!

07:55.495 --> 07:59.081
Don't touch that creepy ass
Deadly Queen's hand.

07:59.374 --> 08:03.378
You just heard the reason
for my not obliterating all of you.

08:03.419 --> 08:05.838
The only souls standing between

08:05.880 --> 08:08.507
me and my peace and tranquility
is you three.

08:08.550 --> 08:10.552
I have no choice
but to battle those

08:10.593 --> 08:12.052
who dare discover my true identity.

08:12.929 --> 08:16.599
Hey, Hayato Kawajiri,
go get behind us now.

08:17.559 --> 08:22.021
Shining Diamond's range
is 1 -2 meters,

08:22.063 --> 08:23.189
it has the ability to correct

08:23.231 --> 08:24.815
that which has been
destroyed or altered.

08:24.899 --> 08:28.110
I won't be needing to fix
anything on you, buddy!

08:28.152 --> 08:30.779
Just a good ol' fashioned
ass kicking for you!

08:40.039 --> 08:41.123
Josuke!

08:44.961 --> 08:46.087
Dora.

08:48.256 --> 08:49.465
He's tough…

08:50.550 --> 08:53.761
<i>Yes! I can't see them,
but hell yeah!</i>

08:54.012 --> 08:56.055
<i>Kira just hacked up blood
and went flying through the air!</i>

08:56.180 --> 08:58.724
You're freak in slow as molasses,
Deadly Queen!

08:58.766 --> 09:01.685
I guess being hell-bent
on peace and tranquility

09:01.769 --> 09:04.313
made you a little lethargic.

09:04.439 --> 09:08.939
Your Stand just isn't cut out
for one-on-one fighting.

09:09.652 --> 09:12.988
Josuke, he's slow,
but don't let down your guard!

09:14.824 --> 09:17.493
If you wanna knock him around
without laying a finger on him,

09:17.535 --> 09:20.371
there's nothing better than
The Hand.

09:21.497 --> 09:22.498
Bring it!

09:24.626 --> 09:27.170
Grabbing sections of the void
to transport, eh?

09:27.253 --> 09:31.753
My aim was for Josuke, but I seem
to have been turned around…

09:33.134 --> 09:35.761
I am now poised to attack you.

09:36.387 --> 09:38.180
It was inside my bag…

09:42.435 --> 09:43.436
What?!

09:47.482 --> 09:49.108
All's well that ends well.

09:49.400 --> 09:52.736
Not bad for beginner's luck.

09:52.820 --> 09:57.320
Nothing was touching me,
nothing at all…

09:57.575 --> 10:01.370
It was the air… the air spit fire!

10:02.246 --> 10:03.622
Okuyasu!

10:05.750 --> 10:09.211
Th-The air… spit fire?

10:09.253 --> 10:10.337
The air…

10:10.588 --> 10:15.088
Now you can see why
I held onto this little darling.

10:16.636 --> 10:20.056
I can use Stray Cat's
air-controlling abilities

10:20.098 --> 10:22.558
in Deadly Queen's explosions.

10:22.642 --> 10:25.895
Hayato, thank you for
carting it all the way here!

10:25.979 --> 10:27.730
The invisibility of air,

10:27.814 --> 10:29.232
the indefensibility
of an explosion!

10:31.401 --> 10:34.987
Could there be a more powerful
combination of elements?

10:35.029 --> 10:37.406
I can't believe he was
nurturing it to do this…

10:37.448 --> 10:40.742
And I'm the one
who brought it here!

10:40.785 --> 10:44.413
I did say luck was finally
on my side, didn't I?

10:44.622 --> 10:46.582
Then again, the two characters
that make up the word luck

10:46.666 --> 10:47.917
are bring and life…

10:48.668 --> 10:50.670
How utterly appropriate.

10:54.882 --> 10:57.509
THE HAND

11:02.640 --> 11:04.683
Is something wrong, Mr. Jotaro?

11:05.435 --> 11:07.186
No, it's nothing.

11:07.603 --> 11:11.481
It's just the rain,
I thought I heard Josuke.

11:11.566 --> 11:14.735
I'm sure the slob overslept again.

11:15.153 --> 11:17.280
If he's not here in five minutes,

11:17.321 --> 11:20.032
I'm going straight to
Hayato Kawajiri's school,

11:20.074 --> 11:22.242
you can wait with everyone else.

11:24.829 --> 11:27.289
You're gonna be
as good as new, Okuyasu!

11:27.373 --> 11:29.208
That's certainly a noble thought.

11:31.169 --> 11:34.213
But first I'm going to
blow you sky high.

11:34.630 --> 11:37.132
It launched air at you
like a bullet!

11:37.175 --> 11:40.178
It's transforming air
into an explosive!

11:41.429 --> 11:44.098
It's coming! You've got to run now!

11:47.351 --> 11:48.518
You can't see it?

11:48.603 --> 11:50.646
It's that weird bubble like thing!

11:50.688 --> 11:53.023
I-It's gonna get you!

11:58.196 --> 11:59.655
Good as new?

11:59.697 --> 12:02.991
He's gonna use his powers
to heal Okuyasu…

12:03.159 --> 12:05.452
The power to correct
that which is broken…

12:05.495 --> 12:07.455
Impressive you were
able to reassemble

12:07.497 --> 12:09.957
broken stone into a wall
within seconds.

12:10.458 --> 12:11.834
I-It's at it again!

12:14.170 --> 12:15.504
I-It's coming!

12:18.466 --> 12:22.470
Nothing evokes more terror
than the act of assumption.

12:22.720 --> 12:26.181
Especially for those who assume

12:26.224 --> 12:29.769
the false superiority of
their own talents and abilities.

12:32.396 --> 12:34.356
I-It's squeezing through!

12:34.398 --> 12:36.733
Contact didn't cause it to explode!

12:44.325 --> 12:47.369
Hmph. I thought the explosion
would decapitate him,

12:47.537 --> 12:50.998
but lucky for him the destructive
force was rather shallow.

12:51.040 --> 12:55.540
Deadly Queen's explosion is not
limited to the objects it touches.

12:56.003 --> 12:58.005
Thinking so would be
an assumption.

12:58.131 --> 13:00.758
It can generate an explosion
at any distance I wish.

13:00.842 --> 13:02.385
No matter where you try to hide,

13:02.468 --> 13:03.886
no matter how quickly you build

13:03.928 --> 13:06.972
a protective stone wall
or metal plate,

13:07.014 --> 13:10.600
my bomb will slip through any
obstacle and execute its target!

13:12.270 --> 13:14.730
Your days of escaping
with your life are over.

13:16.732 --> 13:18.024
Die!

13:20.403 --> 13:22.738
It's no use!
There's no way to dodge it!

13:23.364 --> 13:25.240
Escaping?

13:25.324 --> 13:27.743
I have no intention of escaping…

13:28.077 --> 13:30.287
Never had,
in case you'd like to know.

13:30.371 --> 13:33.290
How else would I heal up Okuyasu!

13:33.624 --> 13:35.917
He's charging right into it?!

13:40.590 --> 13:41.966
He went through it!

13:43.509 --> 13:46.428
I thought you could detonate
that thing at any distance?

13:46.554 --> 13:48.347
I guess there's an exception.

13:48.556 --> 13:53.056
If you were to blow me up
at a range too close to you, Kira,

13:53.769 --> 13:56.855
the result couldn't be very good,
could it?!

13:59.066 --> 14:02.778
All right, Okuyasu.
Now I can fix you.

14:04.906 --> 14:06.282
You can't touch him!

14:06.532 --> 14:11.032
No, he didn't… I think he might've
turned Okuyasu's body into a…

14:13.331 --> 14:15.458
Dammit that brat Hayato…

14:15.666 --> 14:17.959
How could he… no…

14:18.169 --> 14:21.881
I didn't see Deadly Queen
touch Okuyasu.

14:23.299 --> 14:25.634
How do you know this,
Hayato Kawajiri?!

14:25.760 --> 14:27.845
You're not a Stand user!

14:27.929 --> 14:29.055
I'm totally sure!

14:29.180 --> 14:32.057
I've lived in the same house
as him until this morning!

14:32.099 --> 14:33.850
His face tells me everything!

14:33.935 --> 14:35.811
It touched him
before we could notice!

14:35.937 --> 14:36.938
I know that's what happened!

14:36.979 --> 14:39.398
Okuyasu has been
turned into a bomb!

14:40.191 --> 14:42.651
Yoshikage Kira!

14:42.693 --> 14:45.529
There's no telling for sure…

14:45.655 --> 14:47.657
I mean you did storm at me
out of the blue,

14:47.740 --> 14:51.577
I'm really not sure whether
I did in fact touch Okuyasu.

14:51.744 --> 14:54.329
It was all such a blur.

14:54.372 --> 14:57.333
Perhaps I should simply
press the switch and find out?

15:00.211 --> 15:02.713
D-Don't, Yoshikage Kira!

15:03.130 --> 15:05.340
Just hurry up and
shoot your next air missile!

15:05.383 --> 15:08.052
Point that damn thing at me
and shoot, come on!

15:08.135 --> 15:12.514
Now there's no need to be hasty
and shoot you now is there…

15:12.640 --> 15:17.140
Josuke Higashikata, it does me
no harm to observe your movements

15:17.395 --> 15:18.938
and then decide
whether I obliterate you.

15:20.481 --> 15:24.981
Who's to say Okuyasu
isn't a bomb at all.

15:25.152 --> 15:28.029
Maybe you could heal him
with Shining Diamond.

15:28.656 --> 15:31.617
I might be overstepping my bounds,

15:31.659 --> 15:35.954
but at this point you have only one
avenue to saving Okuyasu…

15:35.997 --> 15:38.416
And that is to heal him
through the mode of touch.

15:40.543 --> 15:45.043
Even if he is a human bomb now,
touching him with Shining Diamond

15:47.091 --> 15:51.591
may kill you, but Okuyasu
won't explode into oblivion.

15:51.679 --> 15:53.055
Sacrifice yourself,

15:53.139 --> 15:57.560
and you'll at least heal your dear
friend's critical injuries, yes?

15:57.852 --> 15:59.728
You can't touch him!

15:59.812 --> 16:02.397
I'll wait until
you make your decision.

16:02.565 --> 16:04.900
Do you make physical contact with
your best friend and save his life

16:04.942 --> 16:06.902
or do you charge me?

16:07.153 --> 16:08.529
The choice is yours.

16:10.656 --> 16:14.117
I'll wait as long as it takes,

16:14.201 --> 16:16.494
but it seems
you're averse to touching,

16:16.537 --> 16:18.956
even when it means saving
your number one friend…

16:21.334 --> 16:23.586
I have proof touching him
is deadly!

16:24.378 --> 16:28.673
I know for sure he can control
only one bomb at a time!

16:29.467 --> 16:32.052
Once he's activated one bomb,

16:32.094 --> 16:36.139
he can't use the next one
until the first has exploded.

16:36.223 --> 16:38.725
Otherwise, why wouldn't he launch
a bunch of bombs…

16:38.768 --> 16:40.728
He's using only one at a time!

16:40.770 --> 16:43.522
He's made Okuyasu into a bomb,
so he can't shoot now!

16:43.898 --> 16:45.608
Just what are you getting at?

16:45.733 --> 16:50.070
I'm saying there's a way
to save Okuyasu!

16:50.112 --> 16:51.113
And that's…

16:53.866 --> 16:55.742
Deadly Queen, bomb switch on.

16:57.912 --> 17:00.164
I just need to touch him!

17:02.541 --> 17:03.542
What?!

17:04.377 --> 17:06.504
H-Hayato, you…

17:07.338 --> 17:10.632
I get it now! Shining Diamond!

17:17.598 --> 17:20.392
You're one crazy sonuvabitch,
Hayato Kawajiri…

17:20.434 --> 17:23.395
That took some major balls.

17:24.063 --> 17:27.608
And you're in grade school?

17:27.650 --> 17:30.194
The only way I was able to do it

17:30.277 --> 17:32.654
was because I knew
you could heal me.

17:32.738 --> 17:35.323
Besides, I couldn't just
watch you die.

17:35.408 --> 17:38.744
If you're gone, he'll off me
in the blink of an eye,

17:38.786 --> 17:40.704
and he'll be free
to do whatever he wants.

17:40.788 --> 17:43.207
It's just a matter of time
before he kills my mom…

17:43.290 --> 17:45.166
and more innocent people
right here in this town!

17:45.501 --> 17:47.503
Sorry, but you will die.

17:47.628 --> 17:49.504
To think your power to heal

17:49.588 --> 17:53.842
can reverse my destructive acts
in the fraction of a second…

17:53.884 --> 17:58.384
I had forgotten how utterly
annoying your pathetic power is.

17:59.181 --> 18:00.390
Deadly Queen!

18:01.642 --> 18:04.019
Josuke, he's gonna shoot!

18:10.776 --> 18:12.068
It will detonate on impact

18:12.153 --> 18:14.613
so that you will have
no opportunity to guard.

18:14.655 --> 18:17.616
But because you could
sidestep a contact explosive

18:17.658 --> 18:19.660
if you happen to see it,

18:19.702 --> 18:22.037
I've launched one so small
it's almost impossible to detect.

18:22.246 --> 18:25.832
With Okuyasu on your back,
and those painful shrapnel wounds,

18:25.875 --> 18:28.043
can you really dodge
an explosive projectile…

18:28.127 --> 18:30.170
Just get the hell out of there,
Josuke!

18:30.212 --> 18:33.131
If the explosion so much
as brushes you, you'll be a goner!

18:33.257 --> 18:36.343
Okuyasu! I fixed you all up.

18:36.385 --> 18:38.303
Open your eyes, Okuyasu!

18:38.345 --> 18:40.472
Get out of there! He'll get you!

18:40.514 --> 18:42.766
Eight meters until impact.

18:42.850 --> 18:45.727
It's time to wake up now, buddy!

18:45.769 --> 18:47.562
You're good as new, Okuyasu!

18:47.605 --> 18:48.564
Josuke!

18:48.647 --> 18:49.856
Seven meters to go.

18:49.899 --> 18:53.360
Open your god damned eyes,
Okuyasu! Hey!

18:53.944 --> 18:57.405
Hey, Okuyasu! Quit napping and
open your freak in eyes!

18:57.490 --> 19:00.451
Hey! Let's knock the shit
out of this asshole,

19:00.534 --> 19:02.494
just like the good ol' days!

19:02.828 --> 19:04.579
Josuke…

19:04.830 --> 19:08.291
<i>Like Joe Montana
throwing a touch down pass,</i>

19:08.375 --> 19:11.044
<i>I'll plant my bomb
firmly under your nose,</i>

19:11.086 --> 19:13.421
<i>and detonate the sucker
in the perfect position.</i>

19:13.547 --> 19:15.465
<i>Four meters until impact.</i>

19:15.716 --> 19:19.928
Drop him! You've gotta run,
or it'll hit you dead on!

19:20.012 --> 19:22.639
Okuyasu is… Okuyasu is already…

19:22.723 --> 19:23.932
Shut the hell up!

19:23.974 --> 19:26.267
You're the only one
who needs to run, kid!

19:26.644 --> 19:28.812
<i>Two meters till show time.</i>

19:28.896 --> 19:32.441
<i>The explosion has about
a three-meter radius.</i>

19:34.360 --> 19:38.155
I see it! It's about two meters
in front of you!

19:38.239 --> 19:39.657
You gotta run now!

19:39.740 --> 19:44.161
Okuyasu… Okuyasu is already dead!

19:44.245 --> 19:46.330
He's nowhere near dead, dammit!

19:46.413 --> 19:47.914
Okuyasu is in great shape!

19:47.957 --> 19:49.625
He's going to open his eyes!

19:49.667 --> 19:53.379
<i>One more meter and
the switch goes click.</i>

19:53.420 --> 19:55.046
Josuke!

19:58.509 --> 19:59.885
SPLASH

20:02.721 --> 20:06.141
<i>Th-The air bullet was
ruptured by a blade of blood!</i>

20:06.392 --> 20:08.060
<i>Did Josuke somehow take his blood</i>

20:08.102 --> 20:11.563
<i>and propel it with so much force
that it cut like a knife?</i>

20:11.772 --> 20:13.815
<i>That's it!
Just like that time in the attic…</i>

20:13.857 --> 20:15.817
<i>When I punctured them
with the compass needle,</i>

20:15.859 --> 20:18.194
<i>the cat plant's
air shackles deflated!</i>

20:21.865 --> 20:25.869
He used the blood from his gashes
like a water jet cutter…

20:25.953 --> 20:27.955
to sever it clean through…

20:28.038 --> 20:31.332
But what about
that pressurized air bullet…

20:32.835 --> 20:34.837
It didn't deflate!
It's getting closer!

20:34.920 --> 20:36.713
An air bullet turned
improvised explosive device

20:36.797 --> 20:39.299
is stabilized by Deadly Queen.

20:39.592 --> 20:41.135
That's why it does not deflate!

20:41.176 --> 20:44.179
You can smash it
or dice it into tiny pieces,

20:44.221 --> 20:47.349
but the bomb
will not lose its power!

20:47.641 --> 20:51.353
Of course,
it will detonate on impact.

20:51.937 --> 20:53.021
Yes, finally touch down.

20:54.315 --> 20:56.233
Huh? H-His body…

20:56.734 --> 20:58.193
is floating?

20:58.235 --> 20:59.402
Explode!

21:01.530 --> 21:03.240
No, this isn't floating…

21:10.164 --> 21:14.664
Shining Diamond
won't let me heal myself,

21:15.502 --> 21:17.545
but if it's pieces of road

21:17.630 --> 21:20.716
like the ones that got lodged
in me from that first blast…

21:21.467 --> 21:23.552
that's a whole different story!

21:24.094 --> 21:27.472
The pieces of road stuck in
his body actually pulled him up!

21:29.183 --> 21:30.601
I'm out of options.

21:30.684 --> 21:31.559
This isn't our house,

21:31.602 --> 21:33.604
but it's our refuge for now,
Hayato.

21:33.854 --> 21:36.523
I'm asking you to please leave
Okuyasu behind.

21:36.774 --> 21:39.735
If you continue to carry Okuyasu,
you'll be killed!

21:39.818 --> 21:41.778
He'll corner you
and kill you for sure!

21:41.862 --> 21:44.698
I asked you to keep quiet,
okay, Hayato?

21:44.990 --> 21:48.910
Okuyasu and I have a connection.
He's my friend!

21:48.994 --> 21:51.329
No that's not what I mean!

21:51.372 --> 21:53.290
By the time you healed Okuyasu,
he was already dea—

21:53.374 --> 21:54.750
I said enough!

21:54.792 --> 21:57.753
Enough. Don't say another word.

21:57.795 --> 22:00.255
You've got to focus on beating him!

22:04.051 --> 22:05.510
It makes me sick…

22:05.719 --> 22:08.263
That blasted ability to correct…

22:08.305 --> 22:10.765
without it,
my bomb would be unstoppable.

22:10.849 --> 22:15.270
The greatest obstacle to
my attaining peace and tranquility

22:15.354 --> 22:17.397
isn't Jotaro.

22:18.190 --> 22:19.941
It's him!

22:22.403 --> 22:24.905
Josuke Higashikata!

23:38.896 --> 23:42.024
EPISODE 38
SHINING D (DIAMOND)
IS UNBREAKABLE, PART 2
